    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 37760,
      "end_ms": 41030,
      "text": "他生产的知识拿到人就可以去分享"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 41030,
      "end_ms": 42440,
      "text": "他还有遮遮掩掩啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 42440,
      "end_ms": 43519,
      "text": "你可以去分享"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 43580,
      "end_ms": 44780,
      "text": "你可以去分享"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 44780,
      "end_ms": 45500,
      "text": "允许分享"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 45500,
      "end_ms": 50600,
      "text": "那这个那你这个知识付费付了个毛啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 50600,
      "end_ms": 54530,
      "text": "他只是说为进了他那个知识星球的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 54530,
      "end_ms": 58070,
      "text": "提供什么一对一的咨询服务"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 58070,
      "end_ms": 59699,
      "text": "一对一咨询服务"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 59780,
      "end_ms": 61100,
      "text": "什么咨询服务"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 61100,
      "end_ms": 62840,
      "text": "理财啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 62840,
      "end_ms": 64739,
      "text": "什么经济学动态这种东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 65620,
      "end_ms": 72600,
      "text": "那你说他为什么不能够公开活动呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 72600,
      "end_ms": 74340,
